SAMPL, on the [EQUATOR Network](https://www.equator-network.org/reporting-guidelines/sampl/), is the checklist we will use at the end [Lang and Altman, 2015](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25441757/). The four lines for this room are [SAMPL, in workshop language](#sec-sampl).

## Essentials of statistical literacy

![Poster of fourteen statistical-literacy principles, from variability to critical thinking, with a map from uncertainty to a decision.](figures/sources/statistical-literacy.jpeg){fig-alt="Cheatsheet titled Essentials of Statistical Literacy, with fourteen numbered principles and a seven-step map ending in better decisions." width="42%"}

